CHANGES IN VERSION 1.4
----------------------
 	o French (three-year based) death rates are now available from 1977 to 2025 for Metropolitan France
 	o New death rates (per year) for Metropolitan France from 1946 to 2025
 	o New death rates (per year) for France as a whole from 1994 to 2025

CHANGES IN VERSION 1.2
----------------------
 	o French death rates are now available from 1977 to 2022
 	o Small modifications to fit the CRAN requirements

CHANGES IN VERSION 1.1
----------------------
 	o French death rates are now available from 1977 to 2019
 	o Improved the R code to fit the CRAN requirements

CHANGES IN VERSION 1.0
----------------------
 	o First version of survexp.fr
